WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.200
Designing a product today means six tools around a single part.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.800
And none of them knows why it exists.

3
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:14.600
Export, re-import, redraw: every loop costs days.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.400
Meet DesignWizard.ai.

5
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.600
Design, without the detours.

6
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:29.600
It all starts from intent: what the part connects, its material, its process.

7
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:38.400
The part is born from its interfaces, like a craftsman at the bench. No sketch.

8
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:46.200
A studio that speaks the language of the shop floor. Move a parameter, the part follows.

9
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:55.400
Manufacturing rules run live, with a one-click fix.

10
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:02.600
In the assembly, parts mate themselves, through their interfaces.

11
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:12.200
Change a part: the assembly follows, and interferences are checked.

12
00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:19.600
The circuit board lives in the same project, with the same interfaces.

13
00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:26.400
From functions all the way to fabrication files.

14
00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:33.000
Physics first, through simple models you can redo by hand.

15
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:39.000
Then simulation, cross-checked by the calculation.

16
00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:45.400
And isolation distances, measured across the whole assembly.

17
00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:52.400
The drawing makes itself, and stays up to date.

18
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:58.200
The design review happens in the tool.

19
00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:03.400
And the part goes out to order, with its package.

20
00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:10.400
Artificial intelligence? You hand it a task, as you would a technician.

21
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:16.400
And you review before you accept.

22
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:23.400
Open source, under the MIT licence. Your files stay yours.

23
00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:29.000
Fewer clicks. More engineering.

24
00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.400
DesignWizard.ai. Open the demo.
